### Local requests (cds watch, mocked users from package.json, password "pass")
@host = http://localhost:4004
@employee = taylor.engineer@example.test
@manager = morgan.manager@example.test
@finance = fiona.finance@example.test

### Who am I?
GET {{host}}/odata/v4/user/me()
Authorization: Basic {{employee}}:pass

### My timesheets (row-level: only the logged-in employee's)
GET {{host}}/odata/v4/employee/MyTimesheets?$expand=entries
Authorization: Basic {{employee}}:pass

### Submit the seeded Draft timesheet
POST {{host}}/odata/v4/employee/MyTimesheets(ID=80000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000002,IsActiveEntity=true)/EmployeeService.submitTimesheet
Authorization: Basic {{employee}}:pass
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### Manager approves it (budget roll-up runs automatically)
POST {{host}}/odata/v4/project/Timesheets(80000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000002)/ProjectService.approveTimesheet
Authorization: Basic {{manager}}:pass
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### Project burn summary
GET {{host}}/odata/v4/project/getBurnSummary(projectID=40000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001)
Authorization: Basic {{manager}}:pass

### Finance generates a T&M invoice for October
POST {{host}}/odata/v4/billing/generateInvoice
Authorization: Basic {{finance}}:pass
Content-Type: application/json

{ "projectID": "40000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001", "periodFrom": "2026-10-01", "periodTo": "2026-10-31" }
